# HeyChat needs no environment variables for the hosted version.
#
# The database endpoint is served from the app's own origin (the folk
# platform provides `__folkdata/query`), and there are no API keys in the code.
#
# If you run this outside folk, the data layer will not work unless you
# provide a compatible `__folkdata/query` endpoint on the same origin.
# Nothing in this file is read by the build.
#
# Example placeholders (not used by the code today):
# VITE_APP_NAME=HeyChat
